    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>This is a 2D pixel style PRG game.<br></li><li>Players use the keyboard (WASD), to move the game character, and the mouse to operate the game interface.<br></li><li>Completely randomized terrain, each time you enter a level you will encounter different terrain and monsters.<br></li><li>When monsters die, they drop equipment and skill books, which can be picked up by the player.<br></li><li>Players can wear up to 4 pieces of equipment and 4 skills.<br></li><li>There are currently over 40 pieces of equipment and 10 skills in the game, which players can freely combine.<br></li><li>3 game mode :Adventure mode, free mode, endless mode.<br></li><li> The game is still under development, more equipment and skills will be added in the future.</li></ul>",
